# =============================================================================
# Regenerate Skin & Hair Clinic — environment template (KEYS ONLY, NO VALUES)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Copy to .env.local for local development, or set these in the Vercel project
# (Settings → Environment Variables → Production). Never commit real values.
# Never put the mailbox password anywhere — the enquiry route does not use it.
# =============================================================================

# --- Enquiry delivery via Microsoft Graph (application permission) ----------
# Created in Microsoft Entra ID (Azure AD) → App registrations:
#   1. New registration (single tenant). Copy the Application (client) ID and
#      Directory (tenant) ID.
#   2. Certificates & secrets → New client secret. Copy the VALUE once.
#   3. API permissions → Microsoft Graph → Application permissions →
#      Mail.Send → Grant admin consent.
#   4. Recommended: restrict the app to the reception mailbox only with an
#      Exchange Online ApplicationAccessPolicy, so Mail.Send cannot send as
#      anyone else in the tenant.
#
# While ANY of these four is missing, POST /api/enquiry returns 503 and the
# website shows an honest "email us directly" fallback — it never fakes success.

GRAPH_TENANT_ID=
GRAPH_CLIENT_ID=
GRAPH_CLIENT_SECRET=

# The mailbox that SENDS and RECEIVES enquiries (the app sends as this user).
ENQUIRY_MAILBOX=reception@regenerateskinhairclinic.com.au
